{#- Email capture for a public tool page. Renders only when the page sets
    `toolCapture: <magnet>` in front matter; every gated page leaves it unset
    and gets nothing.

    ⚠️ PLACEMENT IS THE DESIGN DECISION HERE, and it comes from a measurement
    this branch opened with: the plan page put Buy at y=556 and its email
    capture at y=625 — 69 px apart — two competing primary actions in one
    eyeline. So this block sits BELOW the tool and the All-Access CTA stays at
    the foot of the page, with this section between them. They are two asks at
    two moments, never a row of two buttons.

    The done overlay carries a one-line nudge that scrolls here (see
    partials/strength-tool.njk). That is deliberately a link and not a second
    form: a form inside a centred overlay competes with "Repetir" for the same
    40×20mm of phone screen, and the overlay is the worst place on the page to
    type an address.

    Copy: site/_data/capture.json (NOT toolCapture.json — that name would shadow
    the page's own `toolCapture` front matter; the file's own note explains). Endpoint: /api/tool-lead, one webhook for
    every magnet — tool-lead-runbook.md. -#}
{%- set cap = (toolCapture and (capture[toolCapture][lang] or capture[toolCapture].es)) -%}
{%- if cap %}
<section class="tool-capture" id="tool-capture"
         data-magnet="{{ toolCapture }}"
         data-lang="{{ lang }}"
         data-thanks="{{ cap.thanks | escape }}"
         data-error="{{ cap.error | escape }}">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tc-inner">
      <span class="label">{{ cap.kicker }}</span>
      <h2>{{ cap.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ cap.body }}</p>
      <form class="tc-form" id="tcForm" novalidate>
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="tcEmail">{{ cap.placeholder }}</label>
        <input type="email" id="tcEmail" name="email" autocomplete="email"
               placeholder="{{ cap.placeholder }}" required>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary" id="tcSubmit">{{ cap.button }}</button>
      </form>
      <p class="tc-fine">{{ cap.fine }}</p>
      <p class="tc-status" id="tcStatus" role="status" hidden></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ "/assets/js/tool-capture.js" | v }}" defer></script>
{%- endif %}
